From 6254a3efb45244674ba0e43b8394c95ea73f2971 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WWE13 Recomp <wwe13-recomp@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 11:19:18 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 124/124] vulkan: MoltenVK queue statistics in the GPU timing
 census

With MVK_CONFIG_PERFORMANCE_TRACKING=1, logs MoltenVK's statistics once a second as [mvk-stats]
(MTLCommandBuffer commit-to-completion time, encoding, drawable waits, shader compiles). The
setting is also passed through VK_EXT_layer_settings at instance creation, since MoltenVK may
only read environment variables present at launch. vkGetPerformanceStatisticsMVK is taken from
vkGetDeviceProcAddr or the loaded MoltenVK image (through the Vulkan loader the instance-level
lookup returns a trampoline that misreads the VkDevice).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 include/rex/ui/vulkan/instance.h   |   1 +
 src/graphics/vulkan/gpu_timing.cpp | 136 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/graphics/vulkan/gpu_timing.h   |  11 +++
 src/ui/vulkan/vulkan_instance.cpp  |  30 +++++++
 4 files changed, 178 insertions(+)

